  "label": "Warm Beverage as Social Symbol",
  "description": "A warm cup (often coffee, tea, or hot chocolate) is a symbol of comfort, hospitality, and social ritual. It is frequently used in media and culture to represent moments of pause, reflection, or simple pleasure. The meme uses this symbol to convey emotional warmth and contentment, which is culturally understood as a positive and soothing experience.",
